  "item_short_desc": "<p>When presented with a challenge, you proudly roll-up your sleeves, strap your boots, and get &lsquo;er done. Exhibit your industrial prowess and craftmanship with our Getting The Job Done T-Shirt. These iron-willed tees are great for tradesmen, industry workers, mechanics, gearheads, carpenters, or anyone that turns a wrench.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133338",
  "description": "<p>When presented with a challenge, you proudly roll-up your sleeves, strap your boots, and get &lsquo;er done. Exhibit your industrial prowess and craftmanship with our Getting The Job Done T-Shirt. These iron-willed tees are great for tradesmen, industry workers, mechanics, gearheads, carpenters, or anyone that turns a wrench.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Reliable and Long-Lasting:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Go ahead and tackle that weekend project without a worry! Our graphic shirts are made of a durable 60% Cotton / 40% Polyester blend that easily withstands a hard day&rsquo;s work.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>For the Rough and Tough:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These rugged workwear style shirts feature reinforced seams at the collar and sleeves that enhance the shirt&rsquo;s durability, and with a tag-less neck label, you&rsquo;re free to move around without any itches or scratches.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Good Ol&rsquo; American Ingenuity:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These graphic t-shirts are inspired by the tenacity and creativity of the American spirit. The main design is on the back, with a shield and crossed wrenches on the left chest, and an American Flag on the right sleeve.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Fits Like a Glove:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These reliable graphic shirts are standard fit, giving you the perfect amount of room and flexibility for any activity. Their length should go past the waist, providing you with additional coverage.</li>\n</ul>",
